  closest to slope 1: K = 3.0 (exclude |w-w0| < 0.300 rad/s), slope 1.0227, rms 0.1342
  K is O(1)-O(10) in units of the resonance half-width, so the partition
  is the resonance itself: the near-resonant spectrum diffuses (it is
